	(text "ICM-42605 U7  |  I2C address 0x68 (7-bit), AP_AD0 pin1 = GND\nAP_CS pin12 = 3V3 for I2C. SDA GPIO16 / SCL GPIO17; R21/R22 = 4.7k.\nInitial bus speed 100 kHz. AP_AD0 is an input in this configuration.\nINT1 pin4 is NC. Pin9 is unused FSYNC: GND per TDK pin-function table.\nFirmware must keep pin9 as an input and must not enable INT2 output.\nC20: VDDIO pin5; C21/C22: VDD pin8. RESV pin7 = GND; other RESV pins NC.\n6-axis low-noise current: 0.65 mA typical at VDD/VDDIO = 1.8 V; not a 3V3 maximum." (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "791915b0-3bc4-531a-ac00-387164cafb79"))
)
